{%- comment -%}
  Senseless — brand asterisk (identity mark).
  EXACT geometry + colour extracted from assets/senseless-logo-header.svg — the four
  stroked lines of the logo's asterisk mark: vertical, horizontal, and two diagonals,
  stroke rgb(152,74,232) = #984AE8, 3.5 stroke-width, square caps (matching the logo svg).
  This is a VECTOR mark, never a font glyph or typographic "*". Decorative by default
  (aria-hidden) — the adjacent tier label carries the meaning.
  Params:
    size  — px, default 20 (square)
    class — extra CSS classes (optional)
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign sz = size | default: 20
  assign extra = class | default: ''
-%}
<svg class="ss-asterisk {{ extra }}" width="{{ sz }}" height="{{ sz }}" viewBox="-13 -13 26 26" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" style="display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;flex:none;">
  <g stroke="#984AE8" stroke-width="3.5" stroke-linecap="square">
    <path d="M0,-11L0,11"></path>
    <path d="M-11,0L11,0"></path>
    <path d="M-7.8,-7.8L7.8,7.8"></path>
    <path d="M-7.8,7.8L7.8,-7.8"></path>
  </g>
</svg>
